{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T06:00:57.101455Z","id":"e9cc872f7dd32a5facde784775e9084965c2529e70015e462a9c91ad8d13ff6f","body":{"detail":"The routes: GET/POST /api/artifacts, GET /api/artifacts/{aid}, POST /api/artifacts/{aid}/versions, POST /api/sessions, GET /api/sessions/{sid}/feedback, POST .../feedback/ack, POST .../threads/{tid}/comments, POST .../docs:batch, POST /api/stream/{id}. A test of HttpClaxApi over CoreTransport that reaches another route (drafts, questions, inbox, grants, files, thread actions) needs its route and JSON encoder added here; pollFeedback's late answers (QuestionView) are not encoded and throw UnimplementedError at line 181.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":133},"end":{"line":215},"content_hash":"3fbcbe754cee8c4679633731065b7383e898453ea7f2afdc1a4a8fded13a760f"},"summary":"FakeCore.fromApi answers ten of HttpClaxApi's routes; every other path answers 404 not_in_fake, and late question answers throw","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T06:07:12.838052Z","id":"bdacccfcc77178547ffda958582f29772ad07f9992243ab66afa495bfab75bf9","body":{"detail":"FakeCore.subscribe records lastEventId and answers. CoreClient.subscribe throws UnsupportedError for any non-null lastEventId (apps/clax_app/lib/core/core_client.dart:203-208, record 406b9f58). SseClaxStream passes its resume point on every connection after the first (apps/clax_app/lib/clax/stream.dart:172, _resumeId set at 219 and 240), and Task 13 wires `connect: (resume) => CoreTransport(...).sse('/api/stream', resumeId: resume)`. So the first reconnect over the real core throws, while every test over FakeCore passes. Throwing is also the wrong choice: SseClaxStream already handles a connection that opens a new stream instead of resuming (`resumed: false`: it subscribes its topics again and sends each a resync, stream.dart:78-83, 233-240), which is exactly what a subscription without a resume point gives.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":87},"end":{"line":93},"content_hash":"862f8de5b8823abe102d988bb7923a597f02413d238281182ccf02c796b8385a"},"suggested_fix":"In CoreClient.subscribe, ignore lastEventId until clax_embed_subscribe carries it (the hub's ready then reports a new stream, and SseClaxStream resyncs) rather than throwing; record 406b9f58's revisit stays. Whatever CoreClient does, FakeCore.subscribe must do the same, with a test in apps/clax_app/test/core/fake_core_test.dart.","summary":"FakeCore accepts a resume point that CoreClient refuses: tests over the fake pass while the real client throws on every SseClaxStream reconnect","tags":["review","spec:2.4","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T06:07:12.838190Z","id":"87ba1c42423834fb6cfc50a2a06f67936717b00ae9802425e771fb57c89aa16b","body":{"detail":"FakeCore.call dispatches on method and path alone. It ignores CoreRequest.as and host, so a content or shell-page frame to /api/... gets the owner's answer, where the core answers 404 not_in_app (crates/clax-embed/src/core.rs answer(), admit). An owner frame to a route that holds its connection open (/api/stream, /api/events, .../room, .../live, /mcp) gets 404 not_in_fake, where the core answers not_in_app. A transport bug that sends the wrong `as`, or that sends events over call, passes. A route FakeCore.fromApi lacks (record e9cc872f) answers 404, which HttpClaxApi turns into a ClaxApiError with isNotFound, and code that branches on isNotFound alone (apps/clax_app/lib/bundle/installer.dart:398, lib/home/home_install.dart:193, lib/bundle/updater.dart:545) takes its not-found branch instead of failing. FakeSubscription also skips the hub's first ready block, which the real core always sends (spec section 2.4), and FakeCore has no closed or failed state.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":70},"end":{"line":85},"content_hash":"2dc315e9638f0645d7160926ed06c78b62e57beeaa816cad45b30b1b5b26e9f0"},"suggested_fix":"Refuse what the core refuses: a non-owner frame to /api/ and an owner frame to a held-open route answer 404 not_in_app. For an unrouted path, record it in an `unrouted` list that the suite checks is empty in tearDown, or throw a StateError, rather than answering a plausible 404. Have subscribe send a ready block (`{\"stream\": …, \"seq\": 0, \"resumed\": false}`) first, and add FakeCore.close() that makes later calls answer as CoreClient does after close.","summary":"FakeCore answers frames the core would refuse, and a route it lacks answers a 404 that looks like the daemon's: neither fails the test that hits it","tags":["review","spec:6","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T07:12:57.504291Z","id":"1950e9a7be99a34184429255f640d7fa293209409fe003a4d6fa376b4bdd728e","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:34068b30f","summary":"CoreClient.subscribe ignores lastEventId (a new stream whose ready says resumed: false, which SseClaxStream resyncs for) and FakeCore ignores it the same way. Evidence: bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:core_core_client_test PASSED ('a resume point is ignored until the C functions carry one'), core_fake_core_test PASSED.","supersedes":"bdacccfcc77178547ffda958582f29772ad07f9992243ab66afa495bfab75bf9","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T07:13:11.660684Z","id":"f59692c25e2ce08d3e6de6e4f11694cc5fd0f7d31663f1a9b823498130cc6308","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:7f79a6b38","summary":"FakeCore admits frames as crates/clax-embed/src/core.rs admit does (as, host, method, path; held-open routes and /api/admin/shutdown refused) and answers the rest 404 not_in_app; an unrouted call fails the running test via registerException; subscriptions start with the hub's ready block; close() gives a closed state. Evidence: bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:core_fake_core_test PASSED ('refuses what the core refuses: 404 not_in_app', 'a call no route answers fails the test', 'a subscription starts with the hub's ready block', 'a closed core answers no call and ends every subscription').","supersedes":"87ba1c42423834fb6cfc50a2a06f67936717b00ae9802425e771fb57c89aa16b","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T07:13:11.728495Z","id":"6afdfd0f2f2bed685dac432bc9672c43ec4fbaba86299ef878485431153ae67d","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"e9cc872f7dd32a5facde784775e9084965c2529e70015e462a9c91ad8d13ff6f","summary":"Since 7f79a6b38 a path FakeCore.fromApi lacks no longer answers 404 not_in_fake: the call fails the running test (FakeCore.unrouted, registerException by default). The ten-route coverage and the late answers this record names are unchanged.","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T08:47:40.258372Z","id":"df3b454a55d547c861590c4cf0f84a0d99683bf44427381e229f36f2f2f24ff9","body":{"detail":"crates/clax-embed/src/core.rs admit admits a shell-page frame (GET or HEAD) only under /a/, /_clax/, /c/ and /_blob/ (8118e661c, the owner's decision on 05bfd0a7). FakeCore.admits, which its doc says judges as admit does, keeps the old list with /assets/ and /favicon.ico, so a test of the scheme relay (plan Task 15) on FakeCore gets its handler's answer for those paths where the real core answers not_in_app. apps/clax_app/test/core/fake_core_test.dart 'refuses what the core refuses' asserts neither path.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":136},"end":{"line":141},"content_hash":"b558b660f8b2d89c029cd57c967dd128cdde4df4ec9c8e62c8208277863c8e1c"},"suggested_fix":"Drop '/assets/' and the '/favicon.ico' case from FakeCore.admits, and add (GET /assets/x.js as shellPage, false) and (GET /favicon.ico as shellPage, false) to the table in fake_core_test.dart, matching core.rs each_speaker_reaches_only_its_paths.","summary":"FakeCore.admits still lets a shell-page frame reach /assets/ and /favicon.ico, which the core refuses 404 not_in_app since 8118e661c","tags":["review","app","fake","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T09:27:58.337243Z","id":"51092fa435f19cf4af2458003f6c100626fa227d84f4e59a9718126af5674510","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:53d4ba7e9","summary":"Fixed in 53d4ba7e9: FakeCore.admits lets a shell-page frame reach only /a/, /_clax/, /c/ and /_blob/, as crates/clax-embed/src/core.rs admit does. Evidence: apps/clax_app/test/core/fake_core_test.dart 'refuses what the core refuses: 404 not_in_app' now has GET and HEAD /assets/x.js and GET /favicon.ico as a shell page; before the fix it failed ('FakeCore has no route for GET /assets/x.js (as shell-page)'); bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:core_fake_core_test passes after.","supersedes":"df3b454a55d547c861590c4cf0f84a0d99683bf44427381e229f36f2f2f24ff9","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T21:56:50.231971Z","id":"b9dd969a067f393413e07894e272b76fa25f9a9cba08adcaac515ad3ffabb840","body":{"detail":"The routes: GET/POST /api/artifacts, GET /api/artifacts/{aid}, POST /api/artifacts/{aid}/versions, POST /api/sessions, GET /api/sessions/{sid}/feedback, POST .../feedback/ack, POST .../threads/{tid}/comments, POST .../docs:batch, POST /api/stream/{id}. A test of HttpClaxApi over CoreTransport that reaches another route (drafts, questions, inbox, grants, files, thread actions) needs its route and JSON encoder added here; pollFeedback's late answers (QuestionView) are not encoded and throw UnimplementedError at line 181.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":282},"end":{"line":366},"content_hash":"06df8e6d256289ddd002f2b5f1c74e4783f8eca0a24fa377cad7c72be430fc7a"},"summary":"FakeCore.fromApi answers ten of HttpClaxApi's routes; every other path answers 404 not_in_fake, and late question answers throw","supersedes":"e9cc872f7dd32a5facde784775e9084965c2529e70015e462a9c91ad8d13ff6f","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core_jobs.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-21T03:14:37.226852Z","id":"346788e8ad8e78808c03cc7a778c0e04e503bf2a1de5e36b2bd650101b7e365c","body":{"detail":"The store maps DocConflict and DocPinRequired inside a publish step to 409 doc_moved (crates/clax-store/src/jobs.rs doc_refusal). FakeJobs refuses only an if_version unequal to its own count of the document's versions (0 for none), so a test that relies on a write the store refuses for a missing pin, or on a pin's meaning for a missing document, passes here and not against the core.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":486},"end":{"line":505},"content_hash":"a241f88e5bf159b5ff4ced2ae5a6c3f325a35899e154b98e04ba6665c4b30c38"},"summary":"FakeJobs takes a pinned write to a document it does not hold as pinned to version 0, and never refuses an unpinned write (DocPinRequired)","tags":["test-fake","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
